WEBVTT

00:02:28.663 --> 00:02:30.130
And as you sort of mentioned,

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:33.297
there has been a fair amount
of cooperation

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:38.030
between, certainly it seems,
in the pharmaceutical industry, on this.

00:02:38.063 --> 00:02:40.930
Is there anything that has been
surprising about that to you?

00:02:40.963 --> 00:02:43.497
And I'm curious if you have thoughts

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.730
on what governments can actually learn
from industry on this?

00:02:46.763 --> 00:02:52.397
Because, as you said, global cooperation
is really, really important

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:56.263
if we're going to get a grip
on this pandemic and future pandemics.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.097
KMS: So, you know,
the way I look at this, Simone,